help: `Holder` holds a counted handle (`Rc`/`Arc`), so it is copied only explicitly (plans/VALUES_BY_DEFAULT.md decision 17), and it is not `Clone`: give it `derive(Holder, Clone)`, lend it to a `&T` parameter, or move its whole owner. Read it in place with `holders(i)`, write through it with `holders.with(i, ...)`, or give the element `Clone` (a `derive`) to copy it.
